# Build context for service images is the repository root (Step 17). Send the daemon only what the
# Dockerfiles copy: the workspace files, libs/ and services/. Never secrets, .git, PDFs or venvs.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!libs/
!services/
!prompts/
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
